  "description": "<p data-start=\"58\" data-end=\"359\">De Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max is een premium smartphone met een groot Super Retina XDR-display, krachtige prestaties en een geavanceerd camerasysteem. Dankzij de Apple A16 Bionic-chip en het indrukwekkende ProMotion-scherm is dit toestel perfect voor fotografie, videografie, gaming en dagelijks gebruik.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"387\"><strong data-start=\"361\" data-end=\"370\">Staat</strong><br data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"632\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"391\" data-end=\"404\">Voordelen</strong><br data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"407\">⭐ Krachtige Apple A16 Bionic processor<br data-start=\"445\" data-end=\"448\">⭐ Groot 6.7 inch ProMotion OLED-display<br data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"490\">⭐ Professioneel drievoudig camerasysteem<br data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"533\">⭐ Premium afwerking van roestvrij staal<br data-start=\"572\" data-end=\"575\">⭐ Geschikt voor fotografie, videografie en multitasking</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"634\" data-end=\"1169\">📋 <strong data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"654\">Specificaties</strong><br data-start=\"654\" data-end=\"657\"><strong data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"668\">Opslag:</strong> 128GB<br data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"677\"><strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"685\">RAM:</strong> 6GB<br data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"703\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Scherm:</strong> 6.7 inch Super Retina XDR OLED, 2796 × 1290, 120Hz ProMotion<br data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"767\"><strong data-start=\"767\" data-end=\"781\">Processor:</strong> Apple A16 Bionic Hexa-core<br data-start=\"808\" data-end=\"811\"><strong data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"824\">Camera's:</strong> 48MP hoofdcamera + 12MP ultragroothoek + 12MP telelens, 12MP frontcamera<br data-start=\"897\" data-end=\"900\"><strong data-start=\"900\" data-end=\"921\">Batterijconditie:</strong> 85%<br data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"928\"><strong data-start=\"928\" data-end=\"947\">Connectiviteit:</strong> 5G, WiFi 6, Bluetooth 5.3, NFC, Lightning<br data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"992\"><strong data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1014\">Besturingssysteem:</strong> iOS<br data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1021\"><strong data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1031\">Extra:</strong> Dynamic Island, Face ID<br data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1058\"><strong data-start=\"1058\" data-end=\"1068\">Kleur:</strong> Space Black <br data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1142\"><strong data-start=\"1142\" data-end=\"1152\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1227\">📦 <strong data-start=\"1174\" data-end=\"1189\">Meegeleverd</strong><br data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1192\">Apple iPhone 14 Pro Max<br data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1218\">Oplader</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1288\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"1233\" data-end=\"1251\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1254\">Incl. Garantie:</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1229\" data-end=\"1288\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">6 maanden garantie</p>",
